<title>USA: TENNIS-OKLAHOMA CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-OKLAHOMA CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Oklahoma 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $164,250 IGA Tennis Classic on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>1-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat 3-Kimberly Po (U.S.) 1-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>4-Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Francesca Lubiana (Italy) 6-1 6-0</p>
</text>
